OL,3,GNEWSAEnding rough sleeping is 'not just
OL,4,Aa housing issue'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBill Lewis describes life on the
OL,7,Fstreets as lonely, destitute and tough.
OL,9,FThat is, in part, why he is sceptical
OL,10,Fabout whether the prime minister will
OL,11,Fsucceed in ending rough sleeping.
OL,13,F"I doubt that's going to happen," he
OL,14,Freflects.
OL,16,FAndy Burnham's "national drive" to stop
OL,17,Fpeople living in tents or shop doorways
OL,18,Fwill include offering them "a route off
OL,19,Fthe streets by Christmas".
